---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="person" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Security consulting</h2>
		<p>
			Penetration testing, cloud security, incident response, and secure delivery advice from a
			practitioner who has led the work in-house.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="strategy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Attack surface management</h2>
		<p>
			Helping you see what you own, where the risk is, and which controls already help. We also
			build software for this when a point-in-time review is not enough.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="code" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Cloud and engineering</h2>
		<p>
			Azure and AWS security, secure software delivery, and custom tooling that fits the stack you
			already run.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		line-height: 1.25;
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-400);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	@media (min-width: 70em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		}
	}
</style>
